# ============================================================================
# Stage 1a: geometry optimisation + analytical frequencies
#   Level:  B3LYP-D4 / def2-SVP, RIJCOSX with def2/J auxiliary basis
#   Why:    def2-SVP is cheap enough for a laptop and adequate for geometry;
#           the D4 dispersion correction matters for the folded prenyl chain.
#   Cost:   ~30-90 min on 4 cores for 33 atoms. Frequencies roughly double it.
#
#   MEMORY WARNING: %maxcore is PER CORE. 4 x 1200 MB = 4.8 GB.
#   On an 8 GB machine do not exceed this, or you will swap and stall.
# ============================================================================

! B3LYP D4 def2-SVP def2/J RIJCOSX Opt Freq TightSCF

%maxcore 1200
%pal nprocs 4 end

%geom
  MaxIter 200
end

* xyzfile 0 1 ligand.xyz
